    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "attributes": {
          "font-size": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 19
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "PASS N\n\nThe Pass N node sends out triggers when it receives an event or trigger. After it has sent out it's Max Count of triggers it stops working until it's reset.\n\n- Patch Explained -\n•  The Metrone supplies triggers to both Pass N and the Counter.\n•  When Pass N is triggered it triggers the Attack Release which gets mapped and sent to the size of the triangle.\n•  After sending 4 triggers Pass N is disabled as it's max count value is 4.\n•  At the bottom we have the counter increasing by 1 each trigger.\n•  Wrap counts up to 8 before wrapping back to 0 (effectively making a counter up to 8).\n•  When equal to 7 (we're counting from 0), Equal sends a true to the If node which in turn resets the Pass N node.\n•  By doing this we create 8 steps in which the triangle only gets resized the first 4 times."
          }
        },
        "bounds": {
          "height": 275,
          "width": 902,
          "x": 162.203125,
          "y": -36.00782012939453
        },
        "class": {
          "id": "77697265-3C1D-467D-A722-0FC566538374",
          "version": 0
        },
        "clock": "video",
        "constants": {},
        "hidden": [],
        "name": "Comment"
      },
